[00:00.000] 作词 : Mitchell Parish
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Glenn Miller
[00:09.301]I stand at your gate
[00:15.527]And the song that I sing is of moonlight
[00:22.373]I stand and I wait
[00:29.201]For the touch of your hand in the June night
[00:36.555]The roses are sighing
[00:43.432]A moonlight serenade
[00:50.610]The stars are aglow
[00:56.884]And tonight how their light sets me dreaming
[01:04.272]My love, do you know
[01:10.620]That your eyes are like stars brightly beaming?
[01:18.171]I bring you, and sing you
[01:25.567]A moonlight serenade
[01:32.825]Let us stray, till break of day
[01:39.596]In love's valley of dreams
[01:46.410]Just you and I, a summer sky
[01:54.041]A heavenly breeze kissing the trees
[02:01.208]So don't let me wait
[02:07.447]Come to me tenderly in the June night
[02:14.575]I stand at your gate
[02:21.607]And I sing you a song in the moonlight
[02:29.264]A love song, my darling
[02:36.393]A moonlight serenade
